  "usage": {
    "summary": "`good-image-input` accepts one image. Its square shape uses the shared card radius; `shape=\"circle\"` uses the shared round radius. An empty tile opens the native file picker. A selected image fills the tile with `object-fit: cover`. Without preview mode, activating the filled tile also opens the file picker. The optional upload button replaces the image, while the optional X removes it and emits `(removed)` so the application can persist the deletion.",
